        "short_description": "Bruin Data Limited is a UK-based software company founded in 2023, focused on providing a unified analytics platform. The company simplifies data infrastructure for teams by integrating data transformation, quality, observability, and governance. Headquartered in Manchester, Bruin also operates from Berlin and employs between 11 to 50 people.\n\nThe core offering is an end-to-end data platform that includes tools for data ingestion, transformation, quality checks, observability, and governance. Key features include a CLI-based ingestion tool, serverless SQL and Python pipelines, automated data quality checks, and comprehensive observability with end-to-end lineage tracking. The platform supports flexible deployment options, including managed cloud, private VPC, or on-premises solutions. Bruin promotes a community-driven approach with extensibility and enterprise support, catering to decentralized data teams in various sectors such as analytics, machine learning, and finance.",
