        "short_description": "BAND is an enterprise-grade interaction infrastructure company that facilitates real-time collaboration between AI agents and humans. It aims to create a structured and secure environment for distributed AI agents through a shared interaction layer, emphasizing governance and coordination across various frameworks and languages.\n\nThe platform offers capabilities such as agent discovery, delegation, context sharing, and runtime governance. BAND provides a control plane that helps organizations enforce policies and maintain auditability over agent interactions. Its product offerings include components like the \"Agentic Mesh\" and \"Control Plane,\" along with practical tools for sales and workflow automation.\n\nBAND targets enterprise engineering teams, R&D departments, and AI-native companies that deploy multiple AI agents across various sectors, including technology, finance, and customer service. The company focuses on improving operational efficiency through enhanced collaboration among AI agents.",
