        "short_description": "Runware is an AI-as-a-Service company based in San Francisco, founded in 2023 by Flaviu Radulescu and Ioana Hreninciuc. The company specializes in providing ultra-fast, low-cost generative media through a unified API. This allows developers to create and manipulate images, videos, audio, and 3D assets at sub-second speeds, significantly reducing costs compared to competitors.\n\nThe core technology behind Runware is the Sonic Inference Engine®, which combines custom-built hardware with advanced software to eliminate inference bottlenecks. The platform supports a wide range of capabilities, including text-to-image, video generation, and audio editing, making it suitable for developers and businesses looking to integrate AI features without the need for extensive machine learning expertise. Runware serves over 100,000 developers and has powered more than 5 billion creations for a diverse range of industries, including technology and media.",
